<thead><tr><th scope="col">Acute limb ischemia：6 Ps（急性肢體缺血）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>1. Pain</td></tr>
<tr><td>2. <mark data-q="111-22">Pallor（蒼白）</mark></td></tr>
<tr><td>3. Pulselessness</td></tr>
<tr><td>4. Paresthesia</td></tr>
